cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Truck-drone joint delivery: a reproduction and extension study"
abstract: >-
  Independent reproduction of a truck-drone tandem delivery model with
  synchronized rendezvous, bidirectional loads and time-dependent no-fly zones,
  plus a rigorous analysis of a modelling assumption (single w_i flag) that
  provably overstates the paper's optimum, and a boundary analysis of the
  resulting cost reduction under hover-energy pricing, battery-swap duration,
  battery stock, instance form and spatial layout.
authors:
